  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "\"Erlik'in silahhanesi hi\xE7 so\u011Fumaz. Burada d\xF6v\xFClen her k\u0131l\u0131\xE7, yery\xFCz\xFCnde bir sava\u015F\u0131 ba\u015Flatmak i\xE7indir.\""
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Alt\u0131nda k\xF6m\xFCrle yaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015F bir not: \"\xC7ukurlar\u0131n \xFCzerinden ancak ayna gibi ge\xE7ilir.\""
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
